# How the engine draws a card of an own GLB with an alpha mask: vertex normals, sides, the layer's `rotation`
# (reports/engine/2026-11-13-grass/README.md, section 4). The set is built by scripts/content/own_glb_probe.py;
# run with OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<that set>. The panels hang 2.7 m over the hero's spot of the `ledge` view of
# landscape-rock-material.bench and face the first camera.
# The sides of a material (`"two_sided"`, reports/engine/2026-11-16-modern-trees/two-sided.md): the second group
# of the set, a row of cards along Z over a grey plate 2 m over the meadow east of the tavern, tilted to the noon
# sun at -X. `sides-sun` looks from the sun's side at the lit sides and the shadows behind the cards, `sides-lee`
# from the other side at the sides in shade and the shadows before them. The cameras stand by SIDES_CENTRE of the
# script: change both together.
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
set time 12 0
goto pos 35110 3829 429
clear 3000
streaming wait
cam at 35110 4100 99 35110 4100 429
wait 6000
shot front
wait 200
cam at 35110 4100 759 35110 4100 429
wait 4000
shot back
wait 200
# a low sun from the side: the normals against a light that is not overhead
set time 17 30
cam at 35110 4100 99 35110 4100 429
wait 6000
shot front-eve
wait 200

set time 12 0
goto pos 40550 3420 -350
clear 3000
streaming wait
cam at 40150 3800 400 40590 3580 400
wait 6000
shot sides-sun
wait 200
cam at 40970 3740 400 40580 3585 400
wait 4000
shot sides-lee
wait 200
